/**
 * @page gui_tool_index GUI tool
 * 
 * @section gui_summary Summary
 * 
 * ``limeGUI`` provides graphical user interface for interacting with the device configuration and data streaming.
 * 
 * When connected to the device, basic configuration options are presented. Entering the desired parameters and clicking "Submit" will set up the device into a working state.
 *
 * @image{inline} html limeGUI.png
 *
 * When the device is in a configured state, the GUI FFT module can be used to inspect receiver streaming data in real time.
 *
 * @image{inline} html fftview.png
 *
 * For advanced configuration, all parameters can be controlled directly by selecting the desired device module.
 * 
 * @image{inline} html lms7002view.png
 */